Quick-Reference: Which Pattern When

1. Signal in the problem	                           Pattern to reach for
2. "sorted array" + pair/triplet	                   Two pointers
3. "contiguous subarray" + sum/max	                   Sliding window or Kadane's
4. values are in range 1..n	                           Cyclic sort
5. "duplicate/missing number", O(1) space	           Index marking (negate) or cyclic sort
6. need min/max in every window	                       Monotonic deque
7. "next greater/smaller element"	                   Monotonic stack
8. rotated sorted array	                               Modified binary search
9. intervals	                                       Sort by start, then merge
10. matrix traversal/rotation	                       Boundary pointers (top/bottom/left/right)
11. "count pairs/inversions"	                           Merge sort


